{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人錢嘉樂與湯盈盈結婚即將邁入第14個年頭，婚後育有兩名寶貝女兒。</p><p>趁萬聖節，湯盈盈帶同13歲大女錢凱晴（Alyssa）與11歲細女錢凱琪（Kassidy）暢遊主題樂園，並於社交平台分享親子短片，兩女的最新近況隨即引發網民熱烈討論。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.448091+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"4a2d4b40de58eeff58f0ebbe58eb83b3d544064378ba8d13681751f50e5f850d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}